<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠερέθομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείρομαι</span>, only in
			3pl.
		pres. and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hang floating</i> or <i>waving in the air</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγίδα . . , τῆς ἑκατὸν θύσανοι . .
					ἠερέθονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.448
				</span></i>
			; of a flight of locusts, <i><span class="en">
				21.12
			</span></i>; of flying-fish, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.435
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἓξ χεῖρες ἑκάστῳ -ονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.944
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλοτέρων ἀνδρῶν φρένες
				ἠερέθονται</span> young men's minds <i>turn with every
				wind</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.108
			</span></i>.—The form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀερέθονται</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				421.6
			</span></i>.</div>
